<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.Africa Norwich yr shr up, maiden div.</title>
<headline>S.Africa Norwich yr shr up, maiden div.</headline>
<dateline>CAPE TOWN 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yr ended Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>		  (millions of rands unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (cts)	     29.3	vs   21.7</p>
<p>    Div (cts)	     11.5	making 19.5</p>
<p>    Attrib income	 84.02     vs   62.20</p>
<p>    Shareholders income 87.76     vs   67.81</p>
<p>    Life Assurance	69.21     vs   51.79</p>
<p>Health benefit</p>
<p>    administration	 8.19     vs   13.11</p>
<p>    Asset management     1.04     vs    0.39</p>
<p>Unit trust</p>
<p>    management	     2.15     vs    0.28</p>
<p>    Other sources	  7.14     vs    2.31</p>
<p>    Tax			3.72     vs    5.69</p>
<p>Div payable April 25</p>
<p>on register April 4</p>
<p>Full Name: Norwich Holdings SA Ltd (life assurance, investment, fund management)</p>
<p>NOTE - The group said that prospects for the current year were good and profitability would be maintained.</p>
<p>-- Cape Town newsroom +27 21 403-2502</p>
